    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66387" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεσεύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>keep the middle</i> or <i>mean between</i> two, c. gen.,
				<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				756e
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πλάτων μεσεύων Πυθαγόρου καὶ
					Σωκράτους, τοῦ μὲν δημοτικώτερος τοῦ δὲ σεμνότερος
					ὤφθη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Numen.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Eus.
				<u>PE</u>
				14.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> abs.,
				<i>stand midway</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. κατὰ τοὺς τόπους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1327b29
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>to be neutral</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				7.1.43
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				41.46
			</span></i>.</div>
